      "why_read": "Learn how R2C2 guarantees semantic equivalence during C-to-Rust migration by generating machine-checked refinement proofs at the LLVM IR level using AI agents. It reveals a rigorous, foundational approach to bridging differing source-language abstractions without trusting translation models.",
