      "url": "https://github.com/mit-han-lab/EvolvingInfra",
      "date": "2026-11-19",
      "authors": [
        "Hao Kang"
      ],
      "why_read": "Read this to understand how decoupling compute allocation from KV cache management enables online infrastructure adaptation for LLM agents without offline profiling. You will learn architectural mechanisms that significantly reduce latency and boost serving throughput at scale.",
