      "url": "https://github.com/Dimoncelli/wiretuple",
      "date": "2026-11-19",
      "authors": [
        "Dimoncelli"
      ],
      "why_read": "Learn how replacing redundant JSON keys with positional tuples can reduce output token overhead by 35 to 60 percent. It demonstrates a practical proxy-based approach to transparently compress and rehydrate structured LLM responses.",
